        "# TECH 4397: Assignment 7 \u2014 What Happens When the Water Changes?\n",
        "### Guided Computational Experiment: Environmental Matrix Effects\n",
        "\n",
        "**Welcome!** Just like last week, you do not need to write Python code from scratch. \n",
